# would delete the only written record of `--skip-newer-than` vs `--skip-existing`, the
# distinction that cost a 31% pass in R307.
#
# WHY RETIRED, and not merely sentinelled. Each job stops only because of a
# `logs/<job>.DONE` file, and `.gitignore:24` ignores `logs/`. A machine rebuild, a pruned
